{"v":3,"catch":"你具備成為終極海盜文字大師的實力嗎？","desc":"嗨呀，文字獵人！啟航展開驚險的冒險，海上充滿了隱藏的詞語與無盡的寶藏。在 Word Quest: Pirates 中，你將解開刺激的單詞搜尋，打開寶箱，智取對手海盜，並揭開傳說中的戰利品。隨著每個關卡的推進，挑戰不斷升級，你將航行於神祕的島嶼與古老的地圖之間。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-01-22","genres":["交流","益智","學習","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4feae001e4f0c6c301d65765d91ce2f6539db4a88351939540b694d331f265ca.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77c8fd00b7b56f751646a111be51e1deaab4d375e0c6e9d9167a715bb03cb540.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6550e1b4dc86f2c30b9d3f2c577d5ab49f2e186c3d2006a2a70b0d60346586e3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/297d207208354815a06ff9faeb8a3109369f7ab7e56ecc5d83f85b3a8530a4b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/32206c3def840a002690fb45b2a27b0c2462c438f3335ead531475d00a1e1e23.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/424b9a8c59046a438266d50adc6e47c4189f348432535621a6ecc0bc23281114.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e9702591a000","dlc":[]}